    {
        "content": "<p>why is one of the simps projections called <code>null</code>? how did a <code>null</code> even get in there?</p>",
        "id": 618115135,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1787421730
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh <code>null</code> is literally mentioned in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/b4a18d6453839533b10534a138338cd821769d8f/Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Units/Defs.lean#L103\">the command</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">initialize_simps_projections</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Units</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">as_prefix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">val_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">null</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">val_inv</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as_prefix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">val_inv</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 618122307,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1787426303
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Maybe <code>none</code> has a special meaning here and this is a typo?</p>",
